title: From the Platform
subtitle: Our speaker has the floor for an hour.
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_closing = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
var sp = RG.speaker(Q.congress_backing);
Q.congress_speaker_name = sp.name;
Q.congress_speaker_power = sp.power;
Q.congress_speaker_star = sp.power >= 1.25 ? 1 : 0;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= From the Platform

The chair calls [+ congress_speaker_name +]. The hall is full and the gallery fuller; the delegates who were drinking coffee in the corridor come back in. [? if congress_speaker_star = 1 : When this speaker has the floor, even the opposition takes notes. ?]

The motion of the [+ congress_backing_name +] needs to be argued, and the hall is waiting to hear how.

- @principle: Speak to principle.
- @attack: Go after the opposition's record.
- @unity: Appeal for the unity of the party.

@principle
subtitle: A serious speech wins some delegates, and offends nobody.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway((0.04 + Math.random() * 0.04) * Q.congress_speaker_power);
Q['lean_' + Q.congress_backing] += 1;
!}

[+ congress_speaker_name +] speaks for an hour and ten minutes about what the party is for. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : By the end, [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates who came against us are applauding. ?][? if congress_last_moved = 0 : It is admired, and it changes no votes. ?]

@attack
subtitle: Wins more delegates, if it works. The losers will not forget it.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.07 * Q.congress_speaker_power);
RG.congress.bitter(3);
if (Math.random() < 0.25) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    RG.congress.lose(0.04);
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
}
!}

[+ congress_speaker_name +] reads out what the opposition's leaders said a year ago, and what they did afterwards. The hall roars. [? if sys_outcome = 1 : [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates move over to us. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : Then one of them gets the floor for a personal statement, and turns the hall round. We lose friends we had. ?]

@unity
subtitle: Wins fewer votes, and calms the hall.
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.sway(0.03 * Q.congress_speaker_power);
RG.congress.bitter(-2);
Q.unity += 2;
!}

[+ congress_speaker_name +] reminds the delegates who is waiting outside: the police, the Freikorps and the employers. Whatever we decide, we decide it together. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates are moved, and say so. ?]
